    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "mpc-engine 指标状态（诚实标注：无应用指标）",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "### mpc-engine（Rust）当前没有任何 Prometheus 指标端点\n\n核对证据：`mpc-engine/Cargo.toml` 无 prometheus / metrics / actix / axum / warp / hyper 等 HTTP 或指标依赖；`src/`（main.rs/server.rs 等 14 个 .rs）仅 gRPC（tonic，端口 50051，mTLS）。\n\n`deploy/helm/charts/mpc-engine/templates/servicemonitor.yaml` 已存在，但抓取路径 `/metrics` 指向 gRPC 端口（http GET 无法工作）——若该 ServiceMonitor 被 Prometheus 选中，`up{job=~\"mpc-engine\"}` 将恒为 **0（DOWN）**，属预期，并非引擎故障；引擎健康请以 TCP 探活（probes.type=tcp）与签名成功率判断。\n\n本 dashboard 仅保留：真实存在的 **K8s 资源面指标**（cAdvisor `container_*`、kube-state-metrics `kube_*`）与 `up{}` 状态面板；不虚构任何应用指标。",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "up 状态（gRPC 端口不可 HTTP 抓取，预期 0/No data）",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": {
            "options": {
              "0": {
                "color": "red",
                "index": 1,
                "text": "DOWN"
              },
              "1": {
                "color": "green",
                "index": 0,
                "text": "UP"
              }
            },
            "type": "value"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "custom": {}
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "description": "见上方说明：ServiceMonitor 指向 gRPC 端口，HTTP 抓取不可用。",
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "up{job=~\".*mpc-engine.*\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
